msgid ""
"The Portenta H7 uses Arduino's standard **double‑tap reset** to enter "
"Arduino's bootloader. Quickly press the reset button twice — the board "
"re‑enumerates over USB as a DFU device and OpenMV IDE can flash a new "
"firmware image."
msgstr ""
"Portenta H7 使用 Arduino 標準的 **連按兩次重置（double‑tap reset）** 來進入 Arduino "
"的開機載入程式。快速按下重置按鈕兩次——板子會以 DFU 裝置的身分透過 USB 重新列舉，OpenMV IDE 即可燒錄新的韌體映像。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:174
