#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:529
msgid ""
"The **LoRa edition** of the Vision Shield adds a Murata CMWX1ZZABZ LoRaWAN "
"module wired to the Portenta H7 over UART. The ``lora`` module wraps the "
"AT‑command firmware and supports OTAA or ABP join, uplink, and downlink::"
